<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun off recommended list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun off recommended list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it removed Sun Microsystems Inc from its recommended list after the stock hit its $70 price target.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Martin Pyykkonen said he believed the stock was fairly valued at about 70 as 23.2 times his 1996 earnings per share estimate of about $3.02.</p>
<p>-- He said the removal was not based on intermediate term worries due to encroachment from NT or Pentium Pro-based workstations and servers.</p>
</text>
